 src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>更多書架變體為所有木材類型添加了新的書架。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/twjW6Ggd/images/a300ba1e540bbdcb46469c4334f9c385e4f8f009.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>功能包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>為附魔台供能</li>\n<li>可燃（不包括下界木材類型）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以及 Quad 支持，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>熔爐燃料（不包括下界木材類型）</li>\n<li>下界木材防火免疫</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
